 "summary": "GTA 6 hides a gun inside a hanging couch. Go to Port Gellhorn, off Tanglewood Lane: outside a mobile home, look up and you'll see a couch hanging from a tree. Shoot the ropes, the couch crashes down, then sit on it: a unique revolver, the Couch Potato Mustang .357, drops into your arsenal. No mission, no cash, just a seat.",
